include README.md

# fates_edge_client/data/regions/*.json is Fate's Edge Copyright content,
# not MIT like the rest of this package -- explicitly excluded from the
# sdist so it can't end up in a built distribution even if a future
# packaging change re-adds an include_package_data-style default. It stays
# in the source tree for tests/dev use; end users get it via
# `fates-edge data --fetch` instead. See pyproject.toml's
# [tool.setuptools.packages.find] comment and data_fetch.py.
prune fates_edge_client/data
